target/
/autocomplete/
**/*.rs.bk

# vendor/ is pinned crate source; cargo's directory-source checksums verify every
# file at build time. The `target/` rule above also matches vendored crates'
# source dirs (e.g. the cc crate's src/target/), stripping them on commit and
# breaking the offline build. Keep them tracked.
!vendor/**/target/
